      "updated": 1786531246941,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Memory movement\n\n° Just like humans, computers are slow at computing floating-point operations\n  compared to integer oprations\n\n    ==> Try to do 3 x 6 \n          and \n         compare it to 1.21 x 2.789\n\n    ==>  which one can you compute faster ?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Memory movement\n\n° Just like humans, computers are slow at computing floating-point operations\n  compared to integer oprations\n\n    ==> Try to do 3 x 6 \n          and \n         compare it to 1.21 x 2.789\n\n    ==>  which one can you compute faster ?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
