      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "° some quantization algorithms require\n  calibration\n    e.g. Post Training Quantization / static quantization\n\n° calibration is used to determine the\n  scaling factors for activations\n\n° required when quantizing activations\n\n° you use a small dataset for that\n\n° Can also be used for weights quantization",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° some quantization algorithms require\n  calibration\n    e.g. Post Training Quantization / static quantization\n\n° calibration is used to determine the\n  scaling factors for activations\n\n° required when quantizing activations\n\n° you use a small dataset for that\n\n° Can also be used for weights quantization",
